# Build context is the repo root, which sits on a 28 TB volume holding datasets, checkpoints and
# eval outputs. Whitelist instead of blacklist: exclude everything, then re-include only what the
# ctgen submission image copies (vlm3d_challenge_eval/Dockerfile).
*

!src
!vlm3d_challenge_eval

# Re-including a file inside an excluded directory needs every ancestor opened, then re-closed,
# level by level — otherwise the walker never descends into third_party/.
!third_party
third_party/*
!third_party/maisi_bundle
third_party/maisi_bundle/*
!third_party/maisi_bundle/scripts
third_party/maisi_bundle/scripts/*
!third_party/maisi_bundle/scripts/rectified_flow.py

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.omc
